WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.575
Welcome to the Red Team Facilitator orientation.

00:00:03.575 --> 00:00:06.725
Guide Red Team's discussion, review the Scribe handoff,

00:00:06.725 --> 00:00:09.312
project the working record, and submit the final team

00:00:09.312 --> 00:00:11.037
artifact to White Cell.

00:00:11.037 --> 00:00:14.113
Your workflow moves from framing the discussion, to reviewing

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:17.038
the Scribe’s record, to projecting and submitting the agreed

00:00:17.038 --> 00:00:18.113
artifact.

00:00:18.113 --> 00:00:22.350
Keep presentation, editing, and submission as separate decisions

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:22.488
.

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:25.712
The team remains responsible for its judgment, while White

00:00:25.712 --> 00:00:28.175
Cell remains responsible for review.
